{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788328053615601001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"hurt-potential-tapir","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"87b8e236d88594f9d979936561e125d226b1861fc344dbf4d1106031053758bf","event_uuid":"bc05947e-b73d-4d50-b74e-5a4a55454c2e","position":{"commit_sha":"85b1701a2c5e32cf918785a7e4dc98ec1da4808b","position":"1788314857187211001-bc05947e-b73d-4d50-b74e-5a4a55454c2e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"a12827f5ae7a6e4a07de8fe5ca2928ba2151fd2c20586c03a18ba04f7c5057d2","event_uuid":"1a570570-223f-43c2-a0d5-32ad8a52378b","position":{"commit_sha":"01466c089a4bc2576cba38f2e76c1300bdbc4e49","position":"1788314872969692001-1a570570-223f-43c2-a0d5-32ad8a52378b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"85fd738e0c86d9926b78fdfb61613f39a7a6dd4c75dad77b088b7c98c7910b84","event_uuid":"cb837aaf-ec14-40b4-8e75-066c0b50f2c0","position":{"commit_sha":"d6985325f0821aac083f91f1747916c5b7b06013","position":"1788314932871421001-cb837aaf-ec14-40b4-8e75-066c0b50f2c0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"ffa65efd92d5f3c89f2b50625057a3f62fb829f837e0decf282754d4c819cac3","event_uuid":"a7070f4e-f745-440c-954b-65d0de2fa209","position":{"commit_sha":"c24d9b47b74b76317013507fe2fa7a5447edea9a","position":"1788315059821718001-a7070f4e-f745-440c-954b-65d0de2fa209"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788314857187211001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"cb837aaf-ec14-40b4-8e75-066c0b50f2c0","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"8eff-87c1-d09a-4893"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nPrivate aliases remain across plan-review orchestrator sizing/context/move registries, runner Anthropic/tool/structured-run names, workflow gate-dispatch recovery names, and `llm.config` gate-context names. `llm.usage_log.failure_usage` also misnames the neutral `run_shape` record and has live callers. The governing private-shim policy is the direct prerequisite ADR `earthen-wheat-chick`; the parent container is ordered after the LLM configuration-reader extraction.\n\n## Approach\n\nAfter the prerequisite ADR and configuration-reader extraction complete, migrate every consumer to `plan_review.sizing`, `context_assembly`, `passes`, `anthropic_model`, `runner_support`, `structured_run`, `workflow.plan_review_recovery`, and `llm.gate_context`. Rename `failure_usage` completely to `run_shape` and prove emitted dictionaries and durable JSONL rows are byte/field identical. Remove each old private binding only after semantic and raw dynamic/monkeypatch census is empty.\n\n## Scope\n\n- plan-review, runner, workflow-dispatch, and gate-context private re-exports\n- usage-log implementation, callers, docs, experiment prose, and JSONL tests\n- all source/test/string/dynamic/monkeypatch consumers\n\n## Testing\n\nRun focused plan-review/workflow/runner suites; compare old/new usage record dictionaries and JSONL rows across success and failure paths; run semantic and raw reference scans.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Every enumerated old LLM/workflow private binding has no repository consumer and its named canonical owner is the sole binding.\n- [ ] `failure_usage` is absent and `run_shape` owns all former behavior.\n- [ ] Success and failure records retain byte/field-identical dictionaries and durable JSONL rows after the rename.\n- [ ] Gate-context, plan-review recovery, runner, and workflow behavior remain covered by focused tests.\n- [ ] Static, string, dynamic-import, `getattr`, and monkeypatch census proves old paths absent.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review","reason":"remove sizing/context/move-registry compatibility bindings"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/runner.py","reason":"remove private support aliases"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/usage_log.py","reason":"rename failure_usage to run_shape"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/run_failure.py","reason":"migrate live usage callers"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow","reason":"remove gate-dispatch/recovery private aliases"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/config.py","reason":"remove gate-context aliases after reader extraction"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/gate_context.py","reason":"canonical gate-context owner"},{"path":"tests/unit","reason":"migrate tests/patches and prove JSONL parity"},{"path":"docs","reason":"migrate maintained/experiment prose"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","8eff-87c1-d09a-4893"],["parent","6640-ac11-5c55-46b5"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6640-ac11-5c55-46b5","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","llm","workflow","internal-shims"],"ticket_id":"2164-97a8-ca89-4546","ticket_type":"story","title":"Migrate and remove LLM, plan-review, and workflow internal shims","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bc05947e-b73d-4d50-b74e-5a4a55454c2e","1a570570-223f-43c2-a0d5-32ad8a52378b","cb837aaf-ec14-40b4-8e75-066c0b50f2c0","a7070f4e-f745-440c-954b-65d0de2fa209"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788328053615601001,"uuid":"5a111649-c1c1-4692-bb7e-e771b68bbbe5"}